  "query_preview": "/SUNDAY NIGHT THROUGH FRIDAY/...\nIssued at 1110 PM CST Fri Nov 6 2026\n\nSunday will see a bigger jump up in temperatures with highs reaching \nthe upper 50s north to lower 60s central and south as a weak cool \nfront passes through, more or less increasing the west winds during \nthe day. The flow will quickly shift back to the southwest for \nMonday morning, and with that temperatures will rise into the low to \nmid 60s for highs!  Spectacular milder than normal weather will \ncontinue through Wednesday, when another cool front will sweep down \nin northwest flow. The pattern remains dry throughout the \ntransitions in temperatures this week, as moisture is completely cut \noff from our region. The NBM remains dry through the entire forecast \nof the next 7 days.",
